                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today at a @WaysMeansCmte hearing I asked Brian Connell from @BloodCancerUtd what will happen to people with chronic disease if Republicans refuse to extend ACA premium tax credits.\n\nHis answer is chilling: 1.7 million people with chronic illness will be forced off their coverage in the first year \u2014 and premiums will double or triple for 20 million more. People cannot survive this.",
