                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans\u2019 health plan is simple: let ACA tax credits expire, force families onto junk or high-deductible plans, and call it a day. These schemes benefit higher-income households while leaving transplant patients and working families without real coverage. Families need comprehensive ACA coverage, not a savings account that won\u2019t come close to covering an ER visit.",
