                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump has no plan to fix the affordability crisis for working people because he doesn't believe it's real. Instead, he's making things worse: health care premiums are doubling, groceries are up, and tariffs are squeezing families even more. Republicans defending this disastrous record should be ashamed of themselves.",
