                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Americans say affordability is their top concern. Trump and Republicans respond by raising tariffs, letting health care premiums explode, and refusing to lift a finger on housing or groceries. Even their voters think Trump is responsible.\n\u00a0\nDemocrats will keep fighting every day to stop them & lower costs for families. https://t.co/YXnjsu2WbY",
